s</h2>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"t0d55u\" data-start=\"637\" data-end=\"656\">Team Leadership</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"875\">\n<li data-section-id=\"4445xd\" data-start=\"657\" data-end=\"732\">Lead and mentor a team of around 15 integration engineers and team leads.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1rte700\" data-start=\"733\" data-end=\"799\">Conduct regular 1:1s, set goals, and support career development.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1626eyo\" data-start=\"800\" data-end=\"875\">Drive a culture of ownership, accountability, and continuous improvement.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ydobk8\" data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"903\">Operational Excellence</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1212\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1xxnyzm\" data-start=\"904\" data-end=\"1087\">Monitor and improve key metrics such as:\n<ul data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"1087\">\n<li data-section-id=\"blrg23\" data-start=\"949\" data-end=\"965\">SLA compliance</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"lafd6i\" data-start=\"968\" data-end=\"1001\">Mean Time to Integration (MTTI)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"156dogc\" data-start=\"1004\" data-end=\"1034\">Customer Satisfaction (CSAT)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1p3a09o\" data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1066\">Customer Effort Score (CES)</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"175c130\" data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1087\">Escalation rates</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"6on2z2\" data-start=\"1088\" data-end=\"1149\">Manage critical merchant escalations and incident response.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"dgfbzo\" data-start=\"1150\" data-end=\"1212\">Ensure high operational standards with minimal SLA breaches.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"ftetac\" data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1238\">Integration Delivery</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1470\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1wdbhax\" data-start=\"1239\" data-end=\"1310\">Own end-to-end merchant integrations from solution design to go-live.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ohuw0\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1376\">Troubleshoot API, webhook, SDK, and payment integration issues.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1to5935\" data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1470\">Create documentation, SOPs, and runbooks to improve efficiency and reduce recurring issues.</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 data-section-id=\"1cjsrud\" data-start=\"1472\" data-end=\"1517\">Business &amp; Cross-functional Collaboration</h3>\n<ul data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1780\">\n<li data-section-id=\"11mmoeq\" data-start=\"1518\" data-end=\"1594\">Work closely with Product, Engineering, Sales, and Customer Success teams.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"facekh\" data-start=\"1595\" data-end=\"1645\">Translate technical issues into business impact.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1fh1pf8\" data-start=\"1646\" data-end=\"1711\">Identify recurring problems and recommend product improvements.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10jm6yr\" data-start=\"1712\" data-end=\"1780\">Drive adoption of automation and AI tools to improve productivity.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"66wgf7\" data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1808\">Skills &amp; Qualifications</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"2319\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1dl5p4i\" data-start=\"1810\" data-end=\"1919\">5\u20136 years of experience in Solutions Engineering, Integration Engineering, or Technical Account Management.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ugljai\" data-start=\"1920\" data-end=\"1988\">Experience leading technical teams or serving as a technical lead.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"14x7072\" data-start=\"1989\" data-end=\"2072\">Strong understanding of:\n<ul data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2072\">\n<li data-section-id=\"3mxeoj\" data-start=\"2018\" data-end=\"2029\">REST APIs</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1j3x13k\" data-start=\"2032\" data-end=\"2038\">JSON</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1772krs\" data-start=\"2041\" data-end=\"2051\">Webhooks</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1dzqs7t\" data-start=\"2054\" data-end=\"2072\">SDK integrations</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1ry1fut\" data-start=\"2073\" data-end=\"2115\">Payment or fintech experience is a plus.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1nwjp3g\" data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2172\">Experience tracking and improving operational metrics.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"24bgzj\" data-start=\"2173\" data-end=\"2230\">Strong communication and stakeholder management skills.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ahpi66\" data-start=\"2231\" data-end=\"2319\">Familiarity with tools such as Postman, Jira, Freshdesk, DevRev, or similar platforms.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"46wn7q\" data-start=\"2321\" data-end=\"2363\">What Success Looks Like (First 45 Days)</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2668\">\n<li data-section-id=\"1hpiki0\" data-start=\"2365\" data-end=\"2435\">Team performance metrics (MTTI, SLA) are stable and meeting targets.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1qp4kt0\" data-start=\"2436\" data-end=\"2485\">Every team member has a clear development plan.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"837ap1\" data-start=\"2486\" data-end=\"2581\">At least one process improvement has been implemented to reduce manual effort or escalations.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"fzthts\" data-start=\"2582\" data-end=\"2668\">Strong working relationships established with Product, Sales, and Engineering teams.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"nbk8dt\" data-start=\"2670\" data-end=\"2695\">What We're Looking For</h2>\n<ul data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2940\">\n<li data-section-id=\"3bdpx8\" data-start=\"2697\" data-end=\"2739\">Strong technical troubleshooting skills.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"vvqiu3\" data-start=\"2740\" data-end=\"2793\">Excellent people management and coaching abilities.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1b0z5wu\" data-start=\"2794\" data-end=\"2824\">Data-driven decision making.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"os5fn9\" data-start=\"2825\" data-end=\"2881\">Ownership mindset with a focus on solving root causes.</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"18lmbnl\" data-start=\"2882\" data-end=\"2940\">Ability to balance technical depth with business impact.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1\" data-conversation-screenshot-content=\"\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mt-auto grid\">\n<div class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"sticky bottom-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px) col-start-1 row-start-1 self-end\">\n<div class=\"\" data-testid=\"thread-disclaimer\">\n<div class=\"min-h-9 pt-2 text-center text-xs text-token-text-tertiary [view-transition-name:var(--vt-disclaimer)] pb-4 relative overflow-hidden @w-sm/main:px-[60px]\">\n<div class=\"text-base mx-auto [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04\">Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn't discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. </span><br></span></div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3d0a9248-7fff-a2fd-6fa