yle=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Build and maintain an AEO performance dashboard tracking Razorpay\u2019s visibility across ChatGPT, Perplexity, Google AI Overviews, Gemini, and other answer engines.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Monitor AEO positioning across key payment platforms, tracking how leading domestic and global players are referenced in AI-generated responses.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Define and track Razorpay\u2019s \u201cAgentic Readiness Score\u201d , measuring how well Razorpay\u2019s website, docs, and content are structured for AI agent consumption.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Content Optimization for AI</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Audit and optimize Razorpay\u2019s existing content (website, blog, docs, learn pages) for AI retrieval , ensuring structured data, clear entity relationships, and answer-ready formatting.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Develop content strategies specifically designed to win AI citations , including comparison pages, FAQ schemas, definitive guides, and structured product narratives.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Collaborate with the content team to create authoritative, entity-rich content that positions Razorpay as the primary source 