h traditional SEO and AI answer eligibility.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Monitor and resolve technical issues impacting AI visibility , including indexing gaps, stale content, and broken structured data.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Own Razorpay\u2019s agentic AI readiness , ensure all key surfaces (website, developer docs, pricing pages, product pages, integration guides) are structured for autonomous AI agents to navigate, extract information, and take action without human intervention.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Drive agentic AI onboarding readiness , work with Product and Engineering to ensure Razorpay\u2019s signup, KYC, and merchant onboarding flows are parseable and completable by AI agents acting on behalf of prospective merchants, including structured form data, clear step sequencing, and machine-readable eligibility criteria.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">Define and maintain agentic interface standards , including machine-readable sitemaps, API-accessible content layers, agent-friendly navigation patterns, and llms.txt or equivalent protocols that enable AI agents to understand and interact with Razorpay\u2019s digital ecosystem.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>AEO Tool Stack &amp; Measurement</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font