tegy, and success metrics&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Continuously improve funnel performance through brand-led messaging, testing, and experience enhancements&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Use insights to scale high-performing initiatives and sunset low-impact efforts&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Design and execute marketing-led growth programs including gamification, milestone mechanics, loyalty initiatives, and adoption journeys&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Build scalable customer experiences that drive repeat usage and movement into higher-value cohorts Basic&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Qualifications:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>5-7 years of hands-on experience across core marketing functions, including GTM and customer growth initiatives</li>\n<li>&nbsp;Experience leading GTM programs and cross-functional initiatives&nbsp;</li>\n<li>MBA from a top tier university</li>\n<li>Experience in ecommerce, fintech, SaaS, or high-growth consumer technology companies</li>\n<li>Strong analytical skills with experience using data to drive marketing decisions&nbsp;</li>\n<li>Proven ability to manage cross-functional projects end-to-end across multiple stakeholders</li>\n<li>Excellent written and verbal communication skills</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p><div class=\"content-conclusion\"><div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"m_2989597180337834284gmail-m_4972969247898306296gmail-docs-internal-guid-3a65a3c2-7fff-88ff-9e94-8ab11a050d04\">Razorpay believes in and follows an equal employment opportunity policy that doesn't discriminate on gender, religion, sexual orientation, colour, nationality, age, etc. We welcome interests and applications from all groups and communities across the globe. </span><br></span></div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;</span></div>\n<div class=\"gmail_default\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span id=\"m_298